{
    "title": "Annie Baby Monitor: Nanny Cam",
    "description": "Meet a popular free baby cam app & baby tracker that will make your parenting easier. <b><font color=\"#20b2aa\">Annie Baby Monitor</font></b> \ud83d\udc76 helps you keep an eye on your child wherever you are. This baby cam app uses modern monitoring technologies to make babysitting easier!\r\n\r\nHow Annie Baby Monitor app works:\r\n1) Install the app on two mobile devices (smartphone/tablet, Android/iOS)\r\n2) Launch the app on both devices and pair them with a numeric or QR code\r\n3) Put the child unit near your baby\r\n4) Keep the parent unit with you and start monitoring!\r\n\r\nUse Nanny Cam Annie <u>FOR FREE!</u>\r\n\r\n<b>Annie Baby Monitor FREE features:</b>\r\n\u2714 Live video stream in SD\r\n\u2714 Unlimited reach (WiFi, 3G, 4G, 5G, LTE)\r\n\u2714 Audio activity chart\r\n\u2714 Monitoring time\r\n\u2714 Multiplatform support\r\n\u2714 AI chat\r\n\r\n<b>PREMIUM features of nanny cam app Annie:</b>\r\n\u2714 Live video stream in HD\r\n\u2714 Two-way audio & video\r\n\u2714 Night mode (green screen)\r\n\u2714 Lighting\r\n\u2714 Recordings\r\n\u2714 Light intensity\r\n\u2714 Motion detection\r\n\u2714 Noise detection\r\n\u2714 Multi-child & Multi-parent mode\r\n\u2714 Lullabies & white noise\r\n\u2714 Smart notifications\r\n\u2714 Baby tracker (Newborn log)\r\n\u2714 Only one subscription for multiple devices\r\n\r\n<b>UNLIMITED REACH</b>\r\nOur baby monitor works on WiFi, 3G, 4G, 5G and LTE. It will keep you in touch with your child wherever you are, as long as you have an internet connection.\r\n\r\n<b>TWO-WAY VIDEO & AUDIO</b>\r\nWith this baby camera app, you can easily soothe your newborn by interacting with him. Turn on the cam and mic while using our nanny app and talk to your baby.\r\n\r\n<b>NIGHT MODE</b>\r\nThe Annie Baby Monitor feature helps you recognize what your kid is up to at night. Turn on the light on the baby's device and see for yourself. Thanks to our baby cam app, you can monitor your kid around the clock.\r\n\r\n<b>SMART NOTIFICATIONS</b>\r\nYou will always have an overview of what is happening to your child. Our babysitting app will let you know when your kid is awake or in case of a disconnect and low battery.\r\n\r\n<b>LULLABIES AND WHITE NOISE</b>\r\nA lullaby will soothe children and put them to sleep. Annie Baby Monitor app has a player that plays soothing bedtime music. Select from over 15 lullabies and white noises.\r\n\r\n<b>MOTION & SOUND DETECTION</b>\r\nThanks to advanced artificial intelligence technology, our baby camera app can recognize the moves and sounds of the baby. Thus, the app will immediately notify you when any motion is detected.\r\n\r\n<b>HIGH-QUALITY VIDEO & AUDIO</b>\r\nThe baby monitor app allows you to perfectly see and watch your kid during monitoring. Forget about the black&white screen and the intermittent sound. Our nanny cam app allows high-quality video transition in 4K with crystal clear audio.\r\n\r\n<b>BABY TRACKER / NEWBORN LOG</b>\r\nTrack your baby\u2019s habits, health, and all \"firsts\"! Log sleep schedules, breastfeeding, pumping, and more with ease. Collect your newborn\u2019s milestones and simplify your parenting journey with Annie\u2019s baby tracker!\r\n\r\n<b>MULTIPLATFORM SUPPORT</b>\r\nOur baby monitor app is compatible with other Android or iOS devices. Download the app for free on two devices, try it with a three-day trial period, and then buy the subscription type you prefer.\r\n\r\n<b>24/7 SUPPORT</b>\r\nDo you have a problem with using our nanny cam app? Please get in touch with our Annie Baby Monitor team through the in-app contact form.\r\n\r\n<b>MULTIPLE DEVICES</b>\r\nBuy the app once and use it free on more devices with only one subscription. If your grandma wants to join the baby monitoring, not a problem. Our baby cam app allows you to add as many devices to your account as you need.\r\n\r\n<u>TRY BEFORE YOU BUY</u>\r\nThis babysitting app is free to download. You can try all the PREMIUM features during the free 3-day trial. And if you're happy with our baby monitor, you can buy a subscription - weekly, monthly, yearly, or lifetime.\r\n\r\n***\r\nDownload the baby camera app Annie - a video nanny cam & baby tracker app to help you watch your babies!\r\n\r\nInterested in parenting tips? Check out our blog by Annie Baby Monitor https://www.anniebabymonitor.com!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Meet a popular free baby cam app &amp; baby tracker that will make your parenting easier. <b><font color=\"#20b2aa\">Annie Baby Monitor</font></b> \ud83d\udc76 helps you keep an eye on your child wherever you are. This baby cam app uses modern monitoring technologies to make babysitting easier!<br><br>How Annie Baby Monitor app works:<br>1) Install the app on two mobile devices (smartphone/tablet, Android/iOS)<br>2) Launch the app on both devices and pair them with a numeric or QR code<br>3) Put the child unit near your baby<br>4) Keep the parent unit with you and start monitoring!<br><br>Use Nanny Cam Annie <u>FOR FREE!</u><br><br><b>Annie Baby Monitor FREE features:</b><br>\u2714 Live video stream in SD<br>\u2714 Unlimited reach (WiFi, 3G, 4G, 5G, LTE)<br>\u2714 Audio activity chart<br>\u2714 Monitoring time<br>\u2714 Multiplatform support<br>\u2714 AI chat<br><br><b>PREMIUM features of nanny cam app Annie:</b><br>\u2714 Live video stream in HD<br>\u2714 Two-way audio &amp; video<br>\u2714 Night mode (green screen)<br>\u2714 Lighting<br>\u2714 Recordings<br>\u2714 Light intensity<br>\u2714 Motion detection<br>\u2714 Noise detection<br>\u2714 Multi-child &amp; Multi-parent mode<br>\u2714 Lullabies &amp; white noise<br>\u2714 Smart notifications<br>\u2714 Baby tracker (Newborn log)<br>\u2714 Only one subscription for multiple devices<br><br><b>UNLIMITED REACH</b><br>Our baby monitor works on WiFi, 3G, 4G, 5G and LTE. It will keep you in touch with your child wherever you are, as long as you have an internet connection.<br><br><b>TWO-WAY VIDEO &amp; AUDIO</b><br>With this baby camera app, you can easily soothe your newborn by interacting with him. Turn on the cam and mic while using our nanny app and talk to your baby.<br><br><b>NIGHT MODE</b><br>The Annie Baby Monitor feature helps you recognize what your kid is up to at night. Turn on the light on the baby&#39;s device and see for yourself. Thanks to our baby cam app, you can monitor your kid around the clock.<br><br><b>SMART NOTIFICATIONS</b><br>You will always have an overview of what is happening to your child. Our babysitting app will let you know when your kid is awake or in case of a disconnect and low battery.<br><br><b>LULLABIES AND WHITE NOISE</b><br>A lullaby will soothe children and put them to sleep. Annie Baby Monitor app has a player that plays soothing bedtime music. Select from over 15 lullabies and white noises.<br><br><b>MOTION &amp; SOUND DETECTION</b><br>Thanks to advanced artificial intelligence technology, our baby camera app can recognize the moves and sounds of the baby. Thus, the app will immediately notify you when any motion is detected.<br><br><b>HIGH-QUALITY VIDEO &amp; AUDIO</b><br>The baby monitor app allows you to perfectly see and watch your kid during monitoring. Forget about the black&amp;white screen and the intermittent sound. Our nanny cam app allows high-quality video transition in 4K with crystal clear audio.<br><br><b>BABY TRACKER / NEWBORN LOG</b><br>Track your baby\u2019s habits, health, and all &quot;firsts&quot;! Log sleep schedules, breastfeeding, pumping, and more with ease. Collect your newborn\u2019s milestones and simplify your parenting journey with Annie\u2019s baby tracker!<br><br><b>MULTIPLATFORM SUPPORT</b><br>Our baby monitor app is compatible with other Android or iOS devices. Download the app for free on two devices, try it with a three-day trial period, and then buy the subscription type you prefer.<br><br><b>24/7 SUPPORT</b><br>Do you have a problem with using our nanny cam app? Please get in touch with our Annie Baby Monitor team through the in-app contact form.<br><br><b>MULTIPLE DEVICES</b><br>Buy the app once and use it free on more devices with only one subscription. If your grandma wants to join the baby monitoring, not a problem. Our baby cam app allows you to add as many devices to your account as you need.<br><br><u>TRY BEFORE YOU BUY</u><br>This babysitting app is free to download. You can try all the PREMIUM features during the free 3-day trial. And if you&#39;re happy with our baby monitor, you can buy a subscription - weekly, monthly, yearly, or lifetime.<br><br>***<br>Download the baby camera app Annie - a video nanny cam &amp; baby tracker app to help you watch your babies!<br><br>Interested in parenting tips? Check out our blog by Annie Baby Monitor https://www.anniebabymonitor.com!",
